From f2523ed5094e181a89c619827bb836fe446765b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 06:46:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] TEACH-KB: every Teach edit's keypad as golden -- EastSun
 20261002 ruling C (golden, this machine takes the 9046LS arm)

The generated wire data (ht9045_wire_hwteach.js) had every Teach keypad as INTEGER with no range, so the web saved any value
(package 119, GitLab INBOX 140). docs/TEACH_KB_RANGE_HT9050_20261002.md showed golden's ranges clamp 11 positions in use here;
EastSun chose C after reading it.

* FileRW/TeachKb.cpp (new, wb_serve): the 523 golden uteach.dfm TEdit OnClick rows (40 handlers) and W906_TeachKbRange -- the args
  golden passes to ShowQwertyKey: setEditLimitClick :3728-4251 in golden order, setEditZ1AClick, SetEditPickLoaderClick, EditSh1Speed
  (CosFunction), Index1ToSht1Z (fIndexDownPos*100), the 30 MOT[axis].Motor->PSoftLimitP/N handlers; null = golden opens no keypad
  (Fix4X/5X/6X, Auto4X/5X with AUTO_EMPTY_COLOR<3; Index2ToSocketY on 3 axes). Computes only: no fQwertyKey call (the port's
  ShowModal is instant-submit and would clamp the live teach proxies), no file, no card.
* FileRW/Teach.cpp: editlist.get tag=Teach answers extra = {kb, motorSoft}; both edits line-neutral (the declaration takes the empty
  line before namespace, the call goes before the comment on the mustSend line).
* web (separate commit): ht9045_teach_kb_c.js opens golden's keypad from extra.kb, clamps on OK and on Abort (golden Cancel restores
  then CheckRange, myQwertyKeyBoard.cpp:364 / :285-291), edtMoveTo uses the selected axis, WaitTestZDown / TestZSafePos post-steps
  :3736-3756; no extra -> untouched (engine's generic keypad).
* tests/test_teach_kb.cpp (ctest TeachKb, 43 checks): expectations from the independent reading (222 fixed rows on this machine's
  9046LS arm and on the HT9045 arm, 294 soft-limit rows with sim motors, 7 run-time), every other setEditLimitClick branch once, the JSON,
  source pins; argv[2] dumps the JSON for the web probe.

Verified (o2): wb_serve + tests 0 errors; ctest TeachKb 43/43, TeachFormShowBridge, TeachButtonsGen, WebTeachLeave, WebPageTable,
WebMotorAccess 6/6; headless Edge on the real HW.teach.html (fake socket) 24/24 incl. all 522 kb rows opening with golden's Max/Min;
PE 82/82; production_audit 0 changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
