+++ b/page/HW.teach.html
@@ -1180,5 +1180,6 @@ function teachBindGoHints(pts, elByTitle){
 <script src="ht9045_teach_formshow_c.js"></script><!-- AI(W906-TEACH-FORMSHOW) 20261002: golden TfTeach::FormShow screen half (uteach.cpp:1413-2012: ~150 Visible / TabVisible / Caption / Color / Enabled / ActivePage on this machine's options), computed by C++ FileRW/TeachFormShow_File.cpp = GET /api/form/HW.teach.html; applied at load and at every window open. Hand-written. -->
 <script src="ht9045_teach_3axes_c.js"></script><!-- AI(W906-TEACH-3AXES) 20261001: shows the W906 extension teach points of MOutShuttle1/2 (Panel28 setEditOutSht*, gbW906OutShuttle) and MCCDY (gbW906CCDY) only when the C++ Mot_Table has the axis; hidden otherwise. Hand-written, not generated. -->
 <script src="ht9045_teach_zallup_c.js"></script><!-- AI(W906-TEACH-ZALLUP) 20261001: In Z All Up / Out Z All Up (golden uteach.cpp:4466 / :4480) and the Index tab's btnZ1Servo / btnZ2Servo / btnArm1YServo / btnArm2YServo (:4253 / :4270 / :2919) -> motor.access teachZAllUp / teachIndexServo; captions follow the C++ runtime. Hand-written, not generated. -->
+<script src="ht9045_teach_kb_c.js"></script><!-- AI(W906-TEACH-KB) 20261002: every Teach edit's keypad as golden (uteach.dfm OnClick -> ShowQwertyKey, 523 edits / 40 handlers; range computed by C++ FileRW/TeachKb.cpp = editlist.get extra.kb; clamps on OK and on Abort as golden myQwertyKeyBoard.cpp:285-291 / :364; WaitTestZDown / TestZSafePos post-steps :3736-3756). EastSun 20261002 ruling C. Hand-written. -->
 </body>
